1
00:00:00,465 --> 00:00:02,556
What? Then you two...

2
00:00:02,556 --> 00:00:03,106
What about us two?

3
00:00:03,106 --> 00:00:04,929
What are they leaving to you two?

4
00:00:04,929 --> 00:00:08,249
So I want to give back all the benefits that I had to the society.

5
00:00:08,249 --> 00:00:11,027
We started small too and came to where we are today.

6
00:00:11,027 --> 00:00:12,841
It's fun to make money on your own.

7
00:00:12,841 --> 00:00:16,261
Is Jung Hoon a doctor? He will forever earn less money than you.

8
00:00:17,063 --> 00:00:19,953
Looking at the likes of you, you absolutely can't marry him, you useless smartypants!

9
00:00:19,953 --> 00:00:23,691
I don't play games that I can't wait.

10
00:00:24,802 --> 00:00:26,602
You probably put this in your script as well.

11
00:00:26,602 --> 00:00:28,735
I know you married with the bait of being pregnant.

12
00:00:28,735 --> 00:00:31,310
A child? I can give birth to one too.

13
00:00:31,566 --> 00:00:33,971
I haven't been using contraception.

14
00:00:36,033 --> 00:00:37,118
Crazy wench.

15
00:00:37,118 --> 00:00:39,533
- Do you want to stay friends?
- What are you saying?

16
00:00:39,533 --> 00:00:41,865
I'm saying at this point in time we need to settle our relationship.

17
00:00:41,865 --> 00:00:43,871
We can't be like how were were before.

18
00:00:44,654 --> 00:00:46,862
What if I can't be friends?
- Then this is the end.

19
00:00:46,862 --> 00:00:48,356
I have already been to the end.

20
00:00:48,356 --> 00:00:49,615
If you don't want to, forget about it. I won't force it upon you.

21
00:00:49,615 --> 00:00:51,388
Let's do it.

22
00:00:51,388 --> 00:00:53,527
I said, let's do it.

23
00:00:53,527 --> 00:00:57,192
What thing is that your father wil return to society?

24
00:00:57,192 --> 00:00:58,767
Mom!

25
00:00:58,767 --> 00:01:01,460
How could you address me that way in front of your mother, so embarrassingly?!

26
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,479
How much must she look down on me?!

27
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:05,903
You should have told me mom called you.

28
00:01:05,903 --> 00:01:07,487
Is meeting your mother something to be mad about?

29
00:01:07,487 --> 00:01:10,348
I don't want to show you the low she can be.

30
00:01:11,007 --> 00:01:14,596
Fine, how could I win against you? I was wrong. Even if I didn't do anything wrong.

31
00:01:14,596 --> 00:01:15,695
I was wrong. Is that good enough for you?

32
00:01:15,695 --> 00:01:17,373
Kneel.

33
00:01:20,179 --> 00:01:23,260
Stop. I don't like my man kneeling.

34
00:01:35,866 --> 00:01:37,413
Deul Rae!

35
00:01:37,413 --> 00:01:40,114
Deul Rae!

36
00:01:40,114 --> 00:01:42,661
Why do you keep calling my name?

37
00:01:44,617 --> 00:01:45,695
That's a little too young for you to carry.

38
00:01:45,695 --> 00:01:48,479
- I'm buying it for Hye Yoon when you guys marry.
- She doesn't know designer labels.

39
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:50,262
She says she is a designer label. She has a high self esteem.

40
00:01:50,262 --> 00:01:54,367
You're caught again. Do those words mean that your mom looks for designer labels because she has a low self esteem?

41
00:01:54,367 --> 00:01:56,452
No, it's just more realistic. Bread is better than a flower.

42
00:01:56,452 --> 00:01:59,366
Jung Hoon! You are saying that because you don't know women.

43
00:01:59,366 --> 00:02:01,944
When Hye Yoon becomes my daughter in law, she will change.

44
00:02:01,944 --> 00:02:05,262
Meeting arrangement between families of bride and the bridegroom.

45
00:02:10,387 --> 00:02:12,625
I'll go to in front of your house.

46
00:02:12,625 --> 00:02:16,365
Pouter. As if he be could hold out against me without crumbling first?

47
00:02:20,779 --> 00:02:22,616
Mother in law.

48
00:02:23,158 --> 00:02:26,068
- Yes, Mother.
- Hye Yoon, do you have time tomorrow?

49
00:02:26,258 --> 00:02:28,041
I have nothing after school ends.

50
00:02:28,041 --> 00:02:29,912
Then do you want to quickly visit my house?

51
00:02:29,912 --> 00:02:31,043
Yes, mother.

52
00:02:31,043 --> 00:02:34,277
Hye Yoon, I have a lot of expectations and hopes for my daughter-in-law.

53
00:02:34,277 --> 00:02:38,179
Let's have a very close relationship, alright?

54
00:02:38,694 --> 00:02:42,764
- I like it to, mother.
- Alright, I'll see you tomorrow.

55
00:02:48,329 --> 00:02:50,935
You must be feeling good to see your daughter in law.

56
00:02:50,935 --> 00:02:53,582
I like the fact that a woman is coming into our family.

57
00:02:53,582 --> 00:02:58,012
There are some stories only women know. I was lonely in that aspect.

58
00:02:58,012 --> 00:02:59,933
I am a little sad at those words.

59
00:03:00,541 --> 00:03:03,161
Jung Hoon and I have lived as your avatars.

60
00:03:03,161 --> 00:03:06,393
I'm not saying that. I was just jealous of my friends who had daughters.

61
00:03:06,393 --> 00:03:11,720
I wanted to go for a massage and exchanged bags with a daughter.

62
00:03:13,288 --> 00:03:15,501
I'm sorry.

63
00:03:17,072 --> 00:03:20,495
I'm really going to go crazy. I'm falling for you again because you are doing this.

64
00:03:21,190 --> 00:03:22,707
Why don't I hate you?

65
00:03:22,707 --> 00:03:26,752
It's our destiny. Take it in and don't fight it.

66
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:35,270
Episode 3: A dangerous meeting with my girlfriend's family.

67
00:03:36,928 --> 00:03:39,849
Come in. Were you surprised that I called?

68
00:03:39,849 --> 00:03:41,882
Not at all, Mother.

69
00:03:42,516 --> 00:03:44,636
Let's go in.

70
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:51,810
Ahjumma, please bring us some mangoes.

71
00:03:51,810 --> 00:03:53,990
Come here.

72
00:03:55,793 --> 00:03:57,766
Sit.

73
00:03:59,229 --> 00:04:01,270
I told you to come to give you this.

74
00:04:01,270 --> 00:04:04,450
Your purse bothered me the last time you came to our house.

75
00:04:04,450 --> 00:04:06,869
Take it out.

76
00:04:16,504 --> 00:04:19,341
When I went to France, I bought this in a Duty Free Shop and never used it.

77
00:04:19,341 --> 00:04:20,900
Because I wanted to give it to my daughter in law.

78
00:04:20,900 --> 00:04:23,234
It's pretty! It is so gorgeous!

79
00:04:23,234 --> 00:04:25,553
It is isn't it? Try it on.

80
00:04:27,057 --> 00:04:28,918
Oh my goodness it is so pretty!

81
00:04:28,918 --> 00:04:30,406
Use this purse when you come to the meeting.

82
00:04:30,406 --> 00:04:33,563
- Yes.
- This is a bag girls want.

83
00:04:33,563 --> 00:04:35,819
I don't know this kind of thing very well.

84
00:04:35,819 --> 00:04:38,953
No wonder your reaction wasn't good. I thought you disliked it.

85
00:04:38,953 --> 00:04:40,679
No, Mother.

86
00:04:40,679 --> 00:04:42,914
Come here.

87
00:04:48,037 --> 00:04:50,843
I have to show her a good reaction.

88
00:04:51,085 --> 00:04:52,114
Why?

89
00:04:52,704 --> 00:04:54,948
Mother, this looks like a celebrity's room!

90
00:04:54,948 --> 00:04:58,060
I saw something like this on Lee Hyori's reality program.

91
00:04:58,060 --> 00:05:00,165
- What size are your feet?
- 245.

92
00:05:00,165 --> 00:05:05,911
Your feet are big. They aren't like mine. Maybe boots will fit you. I wear my boots in a bigger size.

93
00:05:06,843 --> 00:05:09,042
Sit here.

94
00:05:09,943 --> 00:05:12,258
- Try these on.
- Yes.

95
00:05:21,053 --> 00:05:22,888
- It fits!
- Yes.

96
00:05:22,888 --> 00:05:24,884
Stand up!

97
00:05:25,385 --> 00:05:29,342
It looks good on you. Since you are young you look pretty even when wearing high shoes.

98
00:05:29,342 --> 00:05:31,779
- You can have this too.
- Thank you.

99
00:05:31,779 --> 00:05:34,109
You don't feel bad because I wore this once, right?

100
00:05:34,109 --> 00:05:35,629
Of course not!

101
00:05:35,629 --> 00:05:37,306
The reaction right now wasn't that great either.

102
00:05:37,306 --> 00:05:42,900
I have a flat character. If it is something nice I should say so, but I can't really do that.

103
00:05:43,314 --> 00:05:45,578
The reactions I had were the best I could do.

104
00:05:45,578 --> 00:05:48,409
It is not good to be inexperienced in expressing your feelings.

105
00:05:48,409 --> 00:05:50,731
Yes, I will try my best.

106
00:05:56,820 --> 00:06:01,378
I know you were a nurse's aide. As to your background, you aren't better than I am.

107
00:06:01,378 --> 00:06:05,356
Since you entered and wrecked another person's home, it's not like you're honorable.

108
00:06:07,725 --> 00:06:09,445
What are you doing?

109
00:06:10,536 --> 00:06:13,473
What is all of this? Are you having a party?

110
00:06:13,473 --> 00:06:15,211
Why did you come home early all of a sudden?

111
00:06:15,211 --> 00:06:18,061
My constitution isn't what it used to be so I have to only drink on alternating days.

112
00:06:18,061 --> 00:06:20,355
Give me food.

113
00:06:21,010 --> 00:06:24,192
- What are you looking it? I told you to give me food.
- We are going to.

114
00:06:24,192 --> 00:06:27,092
Were going to eat it all.

115
00:06:44,878 --> 00:06:46,721
Take these off.

116
00:07:00,174 --> 00:07:02,278
What are you doing?

117
00:07:02,278 --> 00:07:04,847
What are you thinking?

118
00:07:05,569 --> 00:07:08,621
Mom called and says for us to come to the family marriage meeting for Hae Yoon.

119
00:07:08,621 --> 00:07:10,562
Don't only the immediate family go to the family marriage meetings?

120
00:07:10,562 --> 00:07:13,650
It is enough that we are family. There are no men in our house.

121
00:07:13,650 --> 00:07:16,303
I don't want to go. I don't want to see your mother pushing herself forward.

122
00:07:16,787 --> 00:07:21,017
Still go even if you don't want to see her. I have many things I do even though I don't want to do them.

123
00:07:22,241 --> 00:07:24,481
Food!

124
00:07:36,104 --> 00:07:37,922
What are you saying?

125
00:07:47,126 --> 00:07:49,149
Are you doing this because, I said I will not go to that meeting?

126
00:07:49,648 --> 00:07:53,979
Blood will tell. You're coarse. I absolutely hate coarse people.

127
00:07:53,979 --> 00:07:56,850
Don't forget it's at the hotel at noon. You should order your food.

128
00:07:56,850 --> 00:07:59,093
It will take a long time to clean up the kitchen.

129
00:08:33,888 --> 00:08:38,003
This is me after a shower. Do Hyun likes it the best. I will ignore your advice.

130
00:08:38,003 --> 00:08:41,748
Because it will be a faster for me to make a move before he does.

131
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:47,009
I love this freedom sensation! and the coffee taste so good.

132
00:09:47,009 --> 00:09:49,561
This is amazing, and this.

133
00:09:49,561 --> 00:09:53,537
Ki Joong, let's not get married and just live like this.

134
00:09:55,021 --> 00:09:57,209
I miss you. Come visit me later, I'll wait for you.

135
00:09:58,379 --> 00:10:00,296
Is it Yuri?
- Yes.

136
00:10:00,296 --> 00:10:02,256
This marriage is lasting longer than I thought it would. Do you love her?

137
00:10:02,256 --> 00:10:05,189
Love? I don't know what love is.

138
00:10:05,189 --> 00:10:08,118
I still can't forget what you said when you were marrying your wife.

139
00:10:08,118 --> 00:10:10,534
I want to protect her, Min Ho. She can not live without me.

140
00:10:10,534 --> 00:10:12,222
She has made me a man.

141
00:10:12,222 --> 00:10:15,664
- Stop saying such things! Did I really say that?
- Yes you did, Hyung.

142
00:10:15,664 --> 00:10:19,910
It's the same anyway. When I lived with my ex-wife now. They are the same.

143
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:22,640
So stop seeing Yuri or cup.
(Yuri means glass in Korean)

144
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:25,680
Was that supposed to be a joke? It's not funny at all.

145
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,768
It is funny. Isn't it funny, Do Hyun?

146
00:10:27,768 --> 00:10:30,489
- It is funny.
- Hey! Do Hyun says it is funny too!

147
00:10:30,489 --> 00:10:31,902
It is always you that is the problem.

148
00:10:31,902 --> 00:10:34,225
You should have broken up nicely with Dong Bi if you were going to break up with her.

149
00:10:34,225 --> 00:10:35,762
You were even doused in water.

150
00:10:35,762 --> 00:10:38,864
Why are you bringing that up, so annoyingly?
- Who was he doused in water by?

151
00:10:38,864 --> 00:10:42,161
You didn't know? By Noonim Deul Rae.
- Noonim Deul Rae? Our aunt?

152
00:10:42,161 --> 00:10:43,316
She is not the type to do that.

153
00:10:43,316 --> 00:10:46,359
How much must he have made a person go crazy for a person who wasn't the type to have done that?

154
00:10:46,359 --> 00:10:51,127
But now that I think about it, when I look at my mother in law, my aunt will also have a sleeping ferocious DNA.

155
00:10:51,127 --> 00:10:52,455
I thought my wife was gentle

156
00:10:52,455 --> 00:10:53,955
but sometimes I can see my mother in law in her.

157
00:10:54,455 --> 00:10:56,967
Ki Joong, in marriage you can't only look at the person directly involved.

158
00:10:56,967 --> 00:10:59,175
Because of my mother in law, I don't feel any affection for my wife.

159
00:10:59,175 --> 00:11:01,438
I agree. Do you know why I broke up with Dong Bi?

160
00:11:01,438 --> 00:11:03,155
She never says anything about her family.

161
00:11:03,155 --> 00:11:05,680
She should have told me what kind of
family, because I know who she really is.

162
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,684
It means she has a complex towards her family.

163
00:11:07,684 --> 00:11:09,952
It is tiring living with a woman who has a complex.

164
00:11:09,952 --> 00:11:12,649
You bastards are so full of yourselves. Do you not have complexes?

165
00:11:12,649 --> 00:11:15,983
A person has to have complexes to seem like a human being.

166
00:11:15,983 --> 00:11:18,257
You guys suck.

167
00:11:18,988 --> 00:11:23,057
You have the key, right? You insert the key into the bike's key hole.

168
00:11:24,078 --> 00:11:26,711
Hold the clutch.

169
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:29,633
Depart.

170
00:12:02,931 --> 00:12:04,664
These disloyal bastards.

171
00:12:04,664 --> 00:12:07,942
Who was it that introduced them? Can't they come out and buy us some dinner?

172
00:12:07,942 --> 00:12:11,907
I'll buy you dinner. They have their family marriage meeting tomorrow, I'm sure they're too busy to come here.

173
00:12:12,633 --> 00:12:13,729
My whole body aches.

174
00:12:13,729 --> 00:12:16,768
Aunt, you have to buy your bike and I'm an unemployed person, let's save money.

175
00:12:16,768 --> 00:12:18,371
Has there been no contact from Min Ho ahjussi?

176
00:12:18,371 --> 00:12:20,588
There was contact just now.
- Ahjussi!

177
00:12:20,588 --> 00:12:23,138
I saw the text late because i was riding a motorcycle.

178
00:12:23,138 --> 00:12:26,010
Hello noonim. I mean... Deul Rae.

179
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:27,430
Why do you have a pain relief patch on?

180
00:12:27,430 --> 00:12:29,955
She's taking a class to get a bike licence.

181
00:12:29,955 --> 00:12:31,123
Why would you tell him that?

182
00:12:31,123 --> 00:12:33,577
I'd know that just by looking at you, Sis.

183
00:12:33,577 --> 00:12:36,950
- I told you not to call me noonim.
- Alright, Deul Rae.

184
00:12:36,950 --> 00:12:40,427
Let's do this in an american style. Drink my friend, okay?

185
00:12:47,941 --> 00:12:53,591
Deul Rae, sign up for our bike club first. You won't be able to do it alone.

186
00:12:53,591 --> 00:12:57,320
Behave yourself. You are younger than me. Don't act like i'm your friend.

187
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,981
You don't like being friends are being called noona. What do you want to do?

188
00:12:59,981 --> 00:13:01,019
You guys should date.

189
00:13:01,019 --> 00:13:03,843
- Are you crazy?
- Are you crazy?

190
00:13:04,643 --> 00:13:08,784
Our opinion on this is the same. Friend, you should drink.

191
00:13:19,805 --> 00:13:21,930
- Bring me some water.
- Go get it yourself.

192
00:13:21,930 --> 00:13:24,570
What's wrong with you recently?

193
00:13:31,019 --> 00:13:33,011
Wash my feet.

194
00:13:33,011 --> 00:13:35,166
You know tomorrow is the meeting, right?

195
00:13:35,166 --> 00:13:37,545
We're going to pick up my mom and aunt. So, sleep early.

196
00:13:37,545 --> 00:13:39,973
Am i your family's clown?

197
00:13:39,973 --> 00:13:43,497
Tell her to stop using her son-in-law.

198
00:13:43,497 --> 00:13:47,408
You stop showing off because you are a doctor. If you aren't a doctor, is there anything to see?

199
00:13:47,408 --> 00:13:49,452
Is your personality or character great?

200
00:13:49,452 --> 00:13:51,819
Why are you being like this? Have you gone crazy?

201
00:13:51,819 --> 00:13:56,555
I'm still popular. Don't start relaxing. Girls in their twenties still say they like me.

202
00:13:57,255 --> 00:13:59,493
Bastard!

203
00:14:10,148 --> 00:14:12,549
Let go of me!

204
00:14:16,786 --> 00:14:21,254
- Let me at least get hit while knowing the reason.
- Trash!

205
00:14:36,161 --> 00:14:39,492
You met Yuri, didn't you?

206
00:14:49,181 --> 00:14:56,059
Now, you are like a human. You were creepy when you let things like this go before.

207
00:15:08,154 --> 00:15:13,635
I know you look down on me because you know i'm never going to divorce you.

208
00:15:14,433 --> 00:15:18,924
End it with her. It was enough that you met her for three years.

209
00:15:18,924 --> 00:15:20,321
There are many young and pretty women.

210
00:15:20,321 --> 00:15:22,375
Like you said, you are still popular.

211
00:15:22,375 --> 00:15:24,752
You will be able to meet another one.

212
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:28,800
I don't want to meet anyone else anymore. Just suck it up.

213
00:15:28,839 --> 00:15:32,785
I hate that woman. She's very rude.

214
00:15:33,144 --> 00:15:40,211
She doesn't have the basics. I will never divorce you. Why would I when I went through so much to get married?

215
00:15:40,610 --> 00:15:42,906
I did everything you wanted me to do.

216
00:15:43,412 --> 00:15:46,804
It is hard to live in a marriage like this. You admit that at the least, right?

217
00:15:47,563 --> 00:15:48,996
Yes.

218
00:15:51,419 --> 00:15:53,322
Show yourself off, for my family.

219
00:15:53,682 --> 00:15:56,497
At the meeting, be good son-in-law for my mom.

220
00:15:56,497 --> 00:16:01,597
Let me hear that I married well.

221
00:16:03,297 --> 00:16:07,297
Those kind of words are what sustains me in this marriage.

222
00:16:19,292 --> 00:16:21,749
If we do the ceremony here, can we get some money back?

223
00:16:21,749 --> 00:16:23,289
Do you want to get married here?

224
00:16:23,289 --> 00:16:26,796
- If I say so, will it come true?
- Yes.

225
00:16:32,384 --> 00:16:35,321
- Oh! How are you?
- Take that off.

226
00:16:35,321 --> 00:16:37,172
Take good pictures. It will become a record starting today.

227
00:16:37,172 --> 00:16:39,790
You two stop whimpering.
There's no wedding gift for you

228
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:42,044
Instead, i will take the pictures and everything.

229
00:16:42,044 --> 00:16:45,191
- This is not right!
- Shut up!

230
00:16:49,938 --> 00:16:53,718
Your parents will sit here.
So bring them here honey, okay?

231
00:17:08,343 --> 00:17:12,269
Don't be like this. You will only get hurt.

232
00:17:16,898 --> 00:17:18,704
Wife.

233
00:17:28,295 --> 00:17:31,028
Stop it.

234
00:17:38,293 --> 00:17:41,264
Why isn't your husband coming in yet? Why isn't he picking up?

235
00:17:41,264 --> 00:17:43,753
He told me he had a surgery. I am guessing he isn't done yet.

236
00:17:43,753 --> 00:17:47,950
Then he should've told us to go there first. We can't be late.

237
00:17:47,950 --> 00:17:55,361
[While waiting for Do Hyun, i heard you have a family meeting today. I guess he will be late.]

238
00:17:56,451 --> 00:17:59,351
- What is it?
- It's nothing.

239
00:17:59,351 --> 00:18:02,072
- What is it?
- Nothing.

240
00:18:02,072 --> 00:18:05,868
- It's probably your husband.
- It probably isn't. Let's go first.

241
00:18:15,934 --> 00:18:18,548
- Hello.
- You already came?

242
00:18:18,548 --> 00:18:21,790
- Were we late?
- Mom and brother in law are not here yet.

243
00:18:21,790 --> 00:18:24,482
- Then we have come first?
- I am sorry.

244
00:18:24,482 --> 00:18:28,174
What is there to be sorry about? There is still time left. We came early.

245
00:18:28,174 --> 00:18:31,445
I feel inferior from the start. They aren't going to be late, right?

246
00:18:31,445 --> 00:18:35,226
How could they when it is such an important meeting? I got a call that they are almost here.

247
00:18:35,226 --> 00:18:38,364
Your skin is better than mine.

248
00:18:38,364 --> 00:18:43,049
My goodness, that is not true! Isn't Hye Yoon so lovely?

249
00:18:43,198 --> 00:18:45,603
In my eyes you are more lovely.

250
00:18:45,603 --> 00:18:49,418
You two... Hye Yoon is the most lovely!

251
00:18:50,169 --> 00:18:53,975
- Shall we take a picture?
- Yes! Hye Yoon, come here and look over there.

252
00:18:54,341 --> 00:18:57,106
I'll take the picture. One, two, three.

253
00:19:07,429 --> 00:19:08,827
We are almost there.

254
00:19:08,827 --> 00:19:12,157
Mother and father are already here! How could you guys do this?

255
00:19:12,157 --> 00:19:14,623
Even if you couldn't come early, you should kept the time!

256
00:19:14,623 --> 00:19:16,851
We are here.

257
00:19:23,724 --> 00:19:26,348
They are too late on a day like this.

258
00:19:26,348 --> 00:19:28,242
Right now, they must be very sorry.

259
00:19:28,242 --> 00:19:31,054
However, they should have been prepared for this at least.

260
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:44,240
Mom, aunt, get off quickly.

261
00:19:46,737 --> 00:19:48,327
What about you?

262
00:19:48,327 --> 00:19:50,753
- I must park the car.
- You can let a valet do that!

263
00:19:51,162 --> 00:19:54,443
Are you trying to ruin the meeting now?

264
00:19:58,828 --> 00:20:00,001
What happened?

265
00:20:00,001 --> 00:20:02,631
We were only late twenty minutes. Don't overreact.

266
00:20:02,631 --> 00:20:04,158
Is twenty minutes small?

267
00:20:05,524 --> 00:20:07,168
Hello.

268
00:20:07,168 --> 00:20:09,157
You came?

269
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:13,882
- They came.
- I'm sorry we were late.

270
00:20:13,882 --> 00:20:19,869
We should have met half way. Since we told you to come in our direction, it would have been difficult predicting the traffic.

271
00:20:19,869 --> 00:20:23,151
Thank you for being so understanding.

272
00:20:23,372 --> 00:20:25,868
This is my son in law.

273
00:20:25,868 --> 00:20:28,514
He works at the most famous beauty clinic in Gang Nam.

274
00:20:28,514 --> 00:20:32,469
He made time because it is family business even on a busy Saturday like this.

275
00:20:32,892 --> 00:20:37,179
We put aside all of our morning appointments because it is an important day.

276
00:20:37,179 --> 00:20:41,018
There are some hospitals that you can and others that you cannot. Am i right?

277
00:20:41,018 --> 00:20:42,687
Yes, you are right.

278
00:20:42,687 --> 00:20:44,751
If there is an emergency patient, we can't put them aside.

279
00:20:44,751 --> 00:20:47,204
Is there emergency patients in a plastic surgery hospital?

280
00:20:47,204 --> 00:20:51,001
I'm sorry. I had a patient that after surgery needed my attention.

281
00:20:51,001 --> 00:20:53,347
Hello, I am Hye Yoon's sister's husband.

282
00:20:53,347 --> 00:20:55,502
I heard about you from my child.

283
00:20:55,502 --> 00:20:57,898
There is a colleague meeting next month. I guess I'll probably see you there as well.

284
00:20:57,898 --> 00:21:00,815
I didn't recognize you since I didn't know you, but now it will be different.

285
00:21:00,815 --> 00:21:03,402
I don't go out to colleague meetings much.

286
00:21:03,402 --> 00:21:06,235
Anyways, it is nice to meet you, junior colleague.

287
00:21:06,510 --> 00:21:08,365
- Let's go.
- Yes.

288
00:21:08,365 --> 00:21:10,941
Mom, come this way.

289
00:21:10,941 --> 00:21:15,198
Aunt, you should sit next to mom, since you are older than Do Hyun.

290
00:21:15,198 --> 00:21:18,542
My daughter is very polite!

291
00:21:42,682 --> 00:21:44,835
Are you Han Chae Young?

292
00:21:45,500 --> 00:21:47,655
Gong Ki Joong?

293
00:21:49,591 --> 00:21:52,579
I'll finish reading this.

294
00:21:53,740 --> 00:21:57,271
Excuse me, please bring me some coffee.

295
00:22:02,728 --> 00:22:05,892
Today is as happy as the day Jung Hoon was born.

296
00:22:05,892 --> 00:22:09,522
Thank you for giving your lovely daughter to my son.

297
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:15,267
She is so precious to me that i can eat her own poop.

298
00:22:16,038 --> 00:22:19,313
It's not that Jung Hoon works in a good company. He is just a salary man.

299
00:22:19,313 --> 00:22:22,024
It will be difficult to support their family by his own.

300
00:22:22,024 --> 00:22:25,553
My daughter will be huge help to their family.

301
00:22:26,113 --> 00:22:30,043
I don't encourage for women who have married to work outside of the home.

302
00:22:30,043 --> 00:22:35,073
With the money that husband earns, she can be good wife and mother.

303
00:22:35,073 --> 00:22:37,926
To be honest, you always lack money no matter how much you spend it.

304
00:22:37,926 --> 00:22:40,654
It is because you don't know since you always stay in your house.

305
00:22:40,654 --> 00:22:44,013
Ten out of ten men want women to work.

306
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:48,500
She had many offers for blind dates, and from men of wealthy families.

307
00:22:49,693 --> 00:22:53,797
Because she became fixated on Jung Hoon, she said she didn't want to meet any more men. That's why we are here.

308
00:22:57,881 --> 00:23:01,314
Were you treated like this in their house?

309
00:23:01,314 --> 00:23:06,156
Thank you for deciding to give us your precious daughter.

310
00:23:06,842 --> 00:23:09,312
You won't regret it if you take her into your family.

311
00:23:09,312 --> 00:23:11,430
Yes.

312
00:23:11,430 --> 00:23:16,336
When should we have the wedding? For us, the faster the better.

313
00:23:16,890 --> 00:23:20,728
It is already November. Let's do it in three months.

314
00:23:21,834 --> 00:23:26,618
That is good. It would get bloody though to find a place for a wedding in three months.

315
00:23:26,618 --> 00:23:27,837
She is crude.

316
00:23:27,837 --> 00:23:31,571
Yes, that is true. It would get bloody.

317
00:23:31,571 --> 00:23:36,674
But must be one place at least.
We have connections. So, don't worry!

318
00:23:36,926 --> 00:23:42,552
If you do the wedding here, they are returning you the money back after one year.

319
00:23:42,552 --> 00:23:44,307
We could do it at this hotel.

320
00:23:44,307 --> 00:23:46,910
That would be too much for our plate.

321
00:23:46,910 --> 00:23:49,615
She never stops talking back.

322
00:23:50,265 --> 00:23:54,042
How would we not be able to find the location? The timing is more of a problem.

323
00:23:54,042 --> 00:23:57,331
Bride's family usually decides the date. Leave that to me.

324
00:23:57,331 --> 00:23:59,050
Yes, please do that.

325
00:23:59,050 --> 00:24:04,072
I will just leave things to you and to my wife.

326
00:24:05,455 --> 00:24:09,930
Let us all have a sip of wine.

327
00:24:20,803 --> 00:24:23,089
Hello.

328
00:24:31,555 --> 00:24:34,642
I was studying MBA at Brown University, but i gave up to start cooking.

329
00:24:34,642 --> 00:24:38,966
Then i went to Paris and i realized what i wanted to do.

330
00:24:38,966 --> 00:24:41,211
- How old were you then?
- 28.

331
00:24:41,211 --> 00:24:45,980
I knew what I wanted when I was in middle school. Having known too early, life is boring.

332
00:24:46,938 --> 00:24:49,220
It's so easy to speak with someone who has the same family standards.

333
00:24:49,220 --> 00:24:52,359
I think I understand what you mean.

334
00:24:52,359 --> 00:24:56,534
You realized that you will live with what you already have and not by getting them working.

335
00:24:56,858 --> 00:25:00,439
Yes, you are right. I want to marry now.

336
00:25:00,439 --> 00:25:03,734
I met many men, but your terms are the best.

337
00:25:03,734 --> 00:25:09,264
I don't like men who work hard. I really hate judges, lawyers and doctors.

338
00:25:09,264 --> 00:25:12,181
- I'll look over it with a positive mind.
- That sounds good.

339
00:25:20,879 --> 00:25:23,809
- I paid.
- No, I'll give you back the money.

340
00:25:23,809 --> 00:25:27,611
Forget it. You're going to spend more money. Save them for that.

341
00:25:28,001 --> 00:25:29,891
Doesn't it bruise your ego after being told such things?

342
00:25:29,891 --> 00:25:31,364
Pardon?

343
00:25:32,201 --> 00:25:34,034
Never mind.

344
00:25:34,034 --> 00:25:38,895
It seems like you don't care one bit. Then you probably will be able to endure in our family.

345
00:25:55,137 --> 00:25:57,396
Hey, honey!

346
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:28,853
You have been lying to me all this time, right? You were faking that Hye Yoon's mother was treating you nicely, right?

347
00:26:28,853 --> 00:26:31,834
What her mother told you when you went to her store?
Tell me everything.

348
00:26:31,834 --> 00:26:33,686
- It's not like that.
- She is treating you like that?

349
00:26:33,686 --> 00:26:35,813
She couldn't have said that only once today.

350
00:26:35,813 --> 00:26:38,280
- It's not like that!
- You are taking her side even now?

351
00:26:38,280 --> 00:26:41,596
You are not mad?
What is that she has and you don't?

352
00:26:41,596 --> 00:26:41,972
Mom.

353
00:26:41,972 --> 00:26:45,619
You choose Hae Yoon cause she's a teacher and so you can live at her expense?

354
00:26:45,619 --> 00:26:46,628
It is not like that!

355
00:26:46,628 --> 00:26:48,267
A wedding at a hotel is too much for our plate?

356
00:26:48,267 --> 00:26:50,323
Is Hye Yoon really her daughter?

357
00:26:50,323 --> 00:26:52,851
They are too different! It is a twist to the story!

358
00:26:53,599 --> 00:26:54,600
I'm sorry.

359
00:26:54,600 --> 00:26:56,012
Collect your mind!

360
00:26:56,012 --> 00:27:00,340
She came late at the meeting because she is looking down on us.

361
00:27:00,340 --> 00:27:02,595
Honey, who's looking down on us?

362
00:27:02,595 --> 00:27:03,598
That makes no sense.

363
00:27:03,598 --> 00:27:06,620
We just went through something that didn't make any sense.

364
00:27:07,340 --> 00:27:10,764
Why do i have to get treated like that?

365
00:27:10,764 --> 00:27:14,287
She says only her daughter is great. What is wrong with Jung Hoon?

366
00:27:14,287 --> 00:27:19,160
Even Ki Hyun bought a present for the first meeting with her mother-in-law.

367
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:22,716
She comes without any presents when I gave her a bag?

368
00:27:24,111 --> 00:27:26,027
I'm sorry.

369
00:27:35,395 --> 00:27:39,884
- Do you have anything else to say?
- Yes, I have a little bit more.

370
00:27:39,884 --> 00:27:43,551
Then cry a little bit more.

371
00:27:56,765 --> 00:27:58,898
Did you go in safely?

372
00:28:10,852 --> 00:28:12,801
Where are you?

373
00:28:13,255 --> 00:28:14,257
Home.

374
00:28:14,257 --> 00:28:16,715
Then why didnt you reply to my text?

375
00:28:16,827 --> 00:28:19,557
Why was your family late on a day like today?

376
00:28:19,557 --> 00:28:22,678
Do you think they were late because they wanted to be? They probably had a reason.

377
00:28:22,678 --> 00:28:25,802
The place should've been the middle distance from each others house.

378
00:28:25,802 --> 00:28:27,703
But we did it close to your home.

379
00:28:27,703 --> 00:28:30,290
It takes time to go from Gan Bok to Gang Nam.

380
00:28:30,673 --> 00:28:32,208
That's enough. Let's hang up.

381
00:28:32,208 --> 00:28:34,942
What are you doing?
Why you acting so half-hearted?

382
00:28:34,942 --> 00:28:37,874
I am not in the mood to talk to you on the phone, so let's hang up.

383
00:28:37,874 --> 00:28:39,811
Why aren't you in the mood to be talking with me?

384
00:28:39,811 --> 00:28:42,177
It is because I am a regular salary man who doesn't have a specialized job.

385
00:28:42,177 --> 00:28:47,946
Are you serious? You still talking about that?
I'm very disappointed on you.

386
00:29:02,280 --> 00:29:05,382
- How is mom?
- She is showering.

387
00:29:05,382 --> 00:29:07,930
- I'm sorry.
- What is there to be sorry about?

388
00:29:07,930 --> 00:29:12,465
You were probably hurt too. People live with their own values.

389
00:29:12,465 --> 00:29:16,439
Hye Yoon's mother is just different from us.

390
00:29:17,549 --> 00:29:21,255
- Are you alright?
- I am not alright. Get out. I hate you.

391
00:29:31,646 --> 00:29:35,002
Your mother is comfortless. Did she have to do that in the meeting?

392
00:29:36,073 --> 00:29:38,510
Let's divorce.

393
00:29:49,155 --> 00:29:51,803
I think I gave you enough time to review.

394
00:29:51,803 --> 00:29:54,136
I did review it. You should get married now.

395
00:29:54,136 --> 00:29:56,856
Why do you bring up marriage when we were talking about business?

396
00:29:56,856 --> 00:29:59,841
In order to succeed in the main stream, a man who is married has a higher advantage.

397
00:30:00,091 --> 00:30:03,942
When you open a restaurant as unmarried man, people think that you're playing around.

398
00:30:03,942 --> 00:30:06,646
If I marry, will you invest in my business?

399
00:30:06,646 --> 00:30:09,463
President Han's daughter is a good marriage partner.

400
00:30:09,777 --> 00:30:11,056
I understand.

401
00:30:11,056 --> 00:30:14,346
- Come eat at our house this week.
- Yes.

402
00:30:19,635 --> 00:30:21,411
My dad finished reviewing our marriage.

403
00:30:21,411 --> 00:30:22,751
Same with my family.

404
00:30:22,751 --> 00:30:24,396
When should we meet each other's parents?

405
00:30:24,396 --> 00:30:26,816
Let's do it next week. Let's move quickly if we have already decided.

406
00:30:26,816 --> 00:30:28,556
That sounds good.

407
00:30:39,945 --> 00:30:42,002
Why do you ride this?

408
00:30:42,002 --> 00:30:45,125
You will know why I ride it when you ride it. Do you want to?

409
00:30:45,125 --> 00:30:49,182
- No I don't want to know.
- That's a good attitude.

410
00:31:10,016 --> 00:31:12,100
Hye Yoon.

411
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:17,573
Hye Yoon.

412
00:31:19,755 --> 00:31:22,538
- Who's call is it?
- Aren't you leaving work?

413
00:31:22,538 --> 00:31:25,672
- Why aren't you picking up?
- I still have work to do.

414
00:31:26,132 --> 00:31:28,259
Do you want to have a drink?

415
00:31:43,691 --> 00:31:48,280
Is something up? I'm worried. Please call me back.

416
00:32:09,967 --> 00:32:14,409
- I'm home.
- What is wrong with you? How much did you drink?

417
00:32:14,409 --> 00:32:16,856
- Mom, I'm sorry.
- What are you sorry about?

418
00:32:16,856 --> 00:32:21,979
For everything!
You are the best, Mom!

419
00:32:39,692 --> 00:32:43,188
Why aren't you replying to me. Already a few days has passed.

420
00:32:44,055 --> 00:32:47,294
- Were you serious about wanting to get married?
- Yes.

421
00:32:47,294 --> 00:32:52,779
I thought you said that just to scare me.
I thought you'd be fine after few days.

422
00:32:54,426 --> 00:32:57,570
She is sending me these and it's not the first time.

423
00:33:00,441 --> 00:33:02,847
I have never been comfortable living with you.

424
00:33:02,847 --> 00:33:07,103
I was just a nurse for you and your wife.

425
00:33:07,103 --> 00:33:08,413
That is your complex!

426
00:33:08,413 --> 00:33:10,710
I thought that too. I was caught up in your logic.

427
00:33:10,710 --> 00:33:15,751
I believed that if I did well, I would be able to be loved by you.

428
00:33:16,338 --> 00:33:18,867
I am tired now.

429
00:33:18,867 --> 00:33:20,385
Divorce is something you have to carefully consider

430
00:33:20,385 --> 00:33:21,885
even more than marriage.

431
00:33:22,385 --> 00:33:24,340
I'm saying that as a divorce man.

432
00:33:24,340 --> 00:33:25,923
Didn't you hear anything of what i just said?

433
00:33:25,923 --> 00:33:27,788
I told you that I didn't have a single day of comfort.

434
00:33:27,788 --> 00:33:29,221
I haven't gone a single day without thinking about divorce.

435
00:33:29,221 --> 00:33:32,272
Alright, I'll do as you like.

436
00:33:37,745 --> 00:33:43,011
You are a very easy man.

437
00:34:01,990 --> 00:34:05,020
Hello.

438
00:34:05,020 --> 00:34:10,143
I don't wonder why you said yes to drink with me.
You're girlfriend was waiting for you.

439
00:34:10,143 --> 00:34:15,385
I'm going. This is my fortune. Who should I drink with?

440
00:34:19,276 --> 00:34:21,940
Why don't you answer my calls?

441
00:34:21,940 --> 00:34:24,341
If I don't answer your calls, there is a reason.

442
00:34:24,341 --> 00:34:26,217
What is that reason?

443
00:34:26,217 --> 00:34:29,087
I needed time to organize my thoughts.

444
00:34:30,042 --> 00:34:32,397
What thoughts?

445
00:34:34,117 --> 00:34:37,773
Let's break up, Hye Yoon.

446
00:34:41,537 --> 00:34:43,639
What did you say?

447
00:34:45,878 --> 00:34:48,928
I'm sorry that you had to come here and hear this.

448
00:34:49,375 --> 00:34:52,049
I was going to call you this weekend.

449
00:34:52,049 --> 00:34:54,910
Why should we break up?

450
00:34:54,910 --> 00:35:00,119
I think I am too lacking for you. Meet a good man.

451
00:35:22,640 --> 00:35:25,502
Don't just say this. Give me a specific reason. Every detail.

452
00:35:25,502 --> 00:35:28,469
Let's not go deeper on that.
It will only heart us more.

453
00:35:28,469 --> 00:35:30,842
This kind of attitude is what is distancing us apart.

454
00:35:30,842 --> 00:35:33,825
Relationships can end because of one small thing.

455
00:35:33,825 --> 00:35:36,865
It's not beacause of world peace or the reunification of South and North.

456
00:35:36,865 --> 00:35:38,327
I don't want to be a coward.

457
00:35:38,902 --> 00:35:44,205
I am not blaming you. I just want to know why you came to think of something so extreme.

458
00:35:46,302 --> 00:35:48,189
Mom cried.

459
00:35:49,422 --> 00:35:53,140
I don't mind to be a coward because i love you.

460
00:35:53,497 --> 00:35:56,613
- But mom is different.
- Why did she cry?

461
00:35:57,488 --> 00:36:00,361
The more we talk, it will become dirty and hurt each other's feelings so let's stop.

462
00:36:00,361 --> 00:36:04,320
No, I need to know. Even if it means it hurts my feelings, I need to know.

463
00:36:04,403 --> 00:36:06,714
So you are saying that you are leaving me because of your mother?

464
00:36:06,714 --> 00:36:09,734
I'm already said it! I think I am too lacking for you.

465
00:36:11,140 --> 00:36:14,536
It's beacause you are just a salary man?

466
00:36:14,771 --> 00:36:17,174
I don't care if we're going to have double income or not.

467
00:36:17,174 --> 00:36:20,426
I don't love you because you are a teacher.
And the same goes for my parents.

468
00:36:20,805 --> 00:36:24,552
But your mother only keeps emphasizing that.

469
00:36:24,552 --> 00:36:26,558
Why does she leave out thanking my parents for raising me well?

470
00:36:26,558 --> 00:36:31,496
My dad thanked your mother a million times for raising you well.

471
00:36:31,496 --> 00:36:34,035
My mom is not good at expressing her feelings.

472
00:36:34,035 --> 00:36:37,566
My mom gave you shoes and a bag before the meeting

473
00:36:37,566 --> 00:36:42,040
- Why didn't you give her any present?
