706
00:54:37,051 --> 00:54:44,280
In America is more easy to file for bankrupt, but i guess it will be possible in Korea, too.

707
00:54:45,263 --> 00:54:47,211
Yes, I'll see you later.

708
00:54:47,211 --> 00:54:49,274
Are you a specialized as a divorce lawyer?

709
00:54:49,274 --> 00:54:51,211
Usually i take every case.

710
00:54:51,211 --> 00:54:53,883
In such a big law firm, they don't divide up the specialties?

711
00:54:53,883 --> 00:54:57,689
That was a very long time ago. Now i'm working by my own.

712
00:54:57,689 --> 00:55:00,677
Why? Isn't a big law firm better?

713
00:55:00,677 --> 00:55:03,976
I got fired. Let's eat.

714
00:55:07,110 --> 00:55:08,123
Yes.

715
00:55:09,373 --> 00:55:10,565
Just a second.

716
00:55:16,313 --> 00:55:18,876
- I'll just go.
- Why?

717
00:55:18,876 --> 00:55:21,853
This was a place I came with Jung Hoon.

718
00:55:32,856 --> 00:55:34,918
Yes, please speak.

719
00:56:04,413 --> 00:56:07,646
- Are you crazy?
- Sorry...

720
00:56:09,579 --> 00:56:11,557
What are you doing not going in?

721
00:56:11,904 --> 00:56:14,035
Didn't you come here to meet Jung Hoon?

722
00:56:14,035 --> 00:56:18,498
Jung Hoon can't be here right now. I guess you have no time since you are the CEO.

723
00:56:18,498 --> 00:56:21,982
- Then why are you here at this time?
- It's a school anniversary.

724
00:56:21,982 --> 00:56:25,968
If it's a school anniversary and you aren't meeting Jung Hoon, why are you here? Did you come to meet me?

725
00:56:26,939 --> 00:56:30,889
A poem says that "habits can be safe".

726
00:56:31,311 --> 00:56:33,853
It's a habit. Go in.

727
00:56:37,883 --> 00:56:40,171
Why is she being like that?

728
00:56:46,400 --> 00:56:49,037
Hye Yoon.

729
00:56:50,752 --> 00:56:54,765
Hye Yoon just came and went. Weren't you two planning to meet?

730
00:56:54,765 --> 00:56:58,455
She is weird these days. She is different from normal. She has her mind elsewhere.

731
00:56:58,455 --> 00:57:00,455
She almost got hit by my bike.

732
00:57:00,455 --> 00:57:05,712
And she was speaking about a poem and habits or something.

733
00:57:20,827 --> 00:57:23,263
Let's talk.

734
00:57:33,217 --> 00:57:36,185
Is it true you broke up with Hye Yoon?

735
00:57:36,375 --> 00:57:37,816
Yes.

736
00:57:37,816 --> 00:57:41,367
- You told Hye Yoon?
- Yes.

737
00:57:42,676 --> 00:57:45,205
Was she accepting?

738
00:57:45,205 --> 00:57:47,877
She would have to accept it.

739
00:57:48,140 --> 00:57:50,422
Marriage is between two female and male adults.

740
00:57:50,422 --> 00:57:57,600
I'm affraid that you will carry the feeling of your mother into your marriage.

741
00:57:58,058 --> 00:57:59,488
I'm sorry.

742
00:57:59,488 --> 00:58:03,865
Keep it in mind. The main focus in marriage is you and Hye Yoon.

743
00:58:03,865 --> 00:58:07,296
Other people are just surrounding people.

744
00:58:07,296 --> 00:58:14,161
Instead of being swayed by the surrounding people, I would like it for you two to make the best possible decision for yourselves.

745
00:58:46,761 --> 00:58:48,973
Why you returning so late at night?

746
00:58:48,973 --> 00:58:51,860
- Why are you lying there?
- Because I am tired.

747
00:58:51,860 --> 00:58:55,187
You're not worry about Hae Yoon?
She looks so depressed.

748
00:58:55,187 --> 00:58:58,748
Do you know what she said earlier? She says she will shave her hair and go into a temple.

749
00:58:58,748 --> 00:59:00,420
What should I do?

750
00:59:01,043 --> 00:59:04,931
You said Dong Bi is Jung Hoon's friend. Tell Dong Bi to gently coax him.

751
00:59:05,249 --> 00:59:07,509
I want to do it, but if they get back together...

752
00:59:07,509 --> 00:59:09,138
then i have to do whatever his family wants.

753
00:59:09,138 --> 00:59:12,059
What? You think you can be slave to someone's pleasure?

754
00:59:12,059 --> 00:59:18,068
It's best if you call his mother and apologize about that day.

755
00:59:18,068 --> 00:59:20,993
Apologize for what?
